lecturer_demonstrates_wirefra_202607101853_mp4","pan":null},{"t":166.29,"len":0.92,"kind":"shot","clip":"04_ultimate-display/sketchpad_embedded_diagram.jpg","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/sketchpad_embedded_diagram.jpg","in":0,"policy":"MUTE","ch":4,"func":"periphery","status":"documented","still":true,"pid":"","pan":{"x":-1.003697077743709,"y":2.7874151580035686,"z":1.0664694915898145}},{"t":167.21,"len":4.99,"kind":"shot","clip":"04_ultimate-display/AI_lecturer_demonstrates_wirefra…_202607101853.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/AI_lecturer_demonstrates_wirefra…_202607101853.mp4","in":0,"policy":"SYNC","ch":4,"func":"human","status":"documented","still":false,"pid":"04_ultimate_display_AI_lecturer_demonstrates_wirefra_202607101853_mp4","pan":null}],"voice":[{"t":15.7,"dur":10,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Early_computer_graphics_wirefram…_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Early_computer_graphics_wirefram…_202607101924.mp4","in":0,"text":"In the 1960s, a small group of engineers began to believe that they could contain the chaos of the world.","kw":["small","group","engineers","began","believe","could","contain","chaos"],"ch":4},{"t":27.06,"dur":6,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Television_weather_map_graphics_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Television_weather_map_graphics_202607101924.mp4","in":0,"text":"This was the moment when we began to believe that the entire world could be managed by data.","kw":["moment","when","began","believe","entire","world","could","managed"],"ch":4},{"t":34.65,"dur":9,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Hand_drawing_wireframe_rooms_cha…_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Hand_drawing_wireframe_rooms_cha…_202607101924.mp4","in":0,"text":"We began to map the world, not as it was, but as a series of cold, predictable spaces.","kw":["began","world","series","cold","predictable","spaces"],"ch":4},{"t":45.52,"dur":9,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Computer_monitor_displaying_text_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Computer_monitor_displaying_text_202607101924.mp4","in":0,"text":"This was the beginning of a world purely defined by the screen.","kw":["beginning","world","purely","defined","screen"],"ch":4},{"t":57.08,"dur":4.32,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Researcher_using_primitive_compu…_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Researcher_using_primitive_compu…_202607101924.mp4","in":0,"text":"In the 1960s, a new vision emerged to manage the world through machines.","kw":["vision","emerged","manage","world","through","machines"],"ch":4},{"t":63.03,"dur":4.34,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Academic_lecturer_demonstrates_p…_202607101853.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Academic_lecturer_demonstrates_p…_202607101853.mp4","in":6.82,"text":"programmable. A new world awaits.","kw":["programmable","world","awaits"],"ch":4},{"t":69.5,"dur":7,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101853_2.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101853_2.mp4","in":0,"text":"By 1965 we believed everything could be captured.","kw":["believed","everything","could","captured"],"ch":4},{"t":81.38,"dur":7,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/AI_computer_lab_reconstruction_202607101853.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/AI_computer_lab_reconstruction_202607101853.mp4","in":0,"text":"The link is transmitting to UCLA. Let's check the host interface.","kw":["link","transmitting","ucla","check","host","interface"],"ch":4},{"t":90.41,"dur":7,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Hand_removing_wooden_chair_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Hand_removing_wooden_chair_202607101924.mp4","in":0,"text":"But this was an illusion managed by the cold mechanics of the state.","kw":["illusion","managed","cold","mechanics","state"],"ch":4},{"t":99.12,"dur":4.88,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Researcher_using_primitive_compu…_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Researcher_using_primitive_compu…_202607101924.mp4","in":4.84,"text":"But this cold logic contained a fatal flaw. It forgot the complexity of human feeling.","kw":["cold","logic","contained","fatal","flaw","forgot","complexity","human"],"ch":4},{"t":110.15,"dur":3.28,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Scientists_pointing_at_screen_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Scientists_pointing_at_screen_202607101924.mp4","in":6.52,"text":"Beneath the surface, the human element was fading.","kw":["beneath","surface","human","element","fading"],"ch":4},{"t":115.58,"dur":5,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Archival_footage_room_security_g…_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Archival_footage_room_security_g…_202607101924.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"designed to track and predict the behavior of millions.","kw":["designed","track","predict","behavior","millions"],"ch":4},{"t":123.51,"dur":5,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/AI_reconstruction_1965_demonstra…_202607101853.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/AI_reconstruction_1965_demonstra…_202607101853.mp4","in":0,"text":"The modern computer processes data.","kw":["modern","computer","processes","data"],"ch":4},{"t":132.5,"dur":3.6,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Scientists_pointing_at_screen_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Scientists_pointing_at_screen_202607101924.mp4","in":2.92,"text":"The data streams are stabilizing at 0.04.","kw":["data","streams","stabilizing"],"ch":4},{"t":139.05,"dur":4,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Model_home_furniture_arranged_li…_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Model_home_furniture_arranged_li…_202607101924.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"where nothing unexpected would ever happen again.","kw":["where","nothing","unexpected","would","ever","happen","again"],"ch":4},{"t":147.79,"dur":4,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Workers_remove_tables_chairs_room_202607101853.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Workers_remove_tables_chairs_room_202607101853.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"where everything would be held forever in a seamless void.","kw":["where","everything","would","held","forever","seamless","void"],"ch":4},{"t":156.52,"dur":3.56,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/AI_lecturer_demonstrates_wirefra…_202607101853.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/AI_lecturer_demonstrates_wirefra…_202607101853.mp4","in":6.52,"text":"Every point corresponds to physical space.","kw":["every","point","corresponds","physical","space"],"ch":4},{"t":163.03,"dur":2.56,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/AI_lecturer_demonstrates_wirefra…_202607101853.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/AI_lecturer_demonstrates_wirefra…_202607101853.mp4","in":3.96,"text":"Every point representation.","kw":["every","point","representation"],"ch":4},{"t":167.21,"dur":4.08,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/AI_lecturer_demonstrates_wirefra…_202607101853.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/AI_lecturer_demonstrates_wirefra…_202607101853.mp4","in":0,"text":"Here we have the precise digital representation.","kw":["here","have","precise","digital","representation"],"ch":4}],"duck":[[0,10.01,0.55],[10.01,11.42,0.55],[15.7,25.95,0.28],[27.06,33.31,0.28],[34.65,43.9,0.28],[45.52,54.77,0.28],[57.08,61.65,0.28],[63.03,67.62,0.28],[69.5,76.75,0.28],[81.38,88.63,0.28],[90.41,97.66,0.28],[99.12,104.25,0.28],[110.15,113.68,0.28],[115.58,120.83,0.28],[123.51,128.76,0.28],[132.5,136.35,0.28],[139.05,143.3,0.28],[147.79,152.04,0.28],[151.86,154.83,0.55],[156.52,160.33,0.28],[163.03,165.84,0.28],[167.21,171.54,0.28]],"coverage":0.833,"used":35,"pool":42,"speech":0.602,"eras":[4],"filmName":"SWEEP 60 FILM ch4"}